*> vybe-test: cobol/level_numbers/test_level_nesting_basics
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_level_numbers.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-GROUP.
   05 WS-SUB1 PIC X(3) VALUE "ABC".
   05 WS-SUB2 PIC X(3) VALUE "DEF".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY WS-GROUP.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-GROUP DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ABCDEF"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ABCDEF] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-SUB1.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-SUB1 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ABC"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ABC] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-SUB2.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-SUB2 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "DEF"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [DEF] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

